Similar to sentry stratagems, the gun targets and shoots at any non-Helldiver hostiles within 30 metres.

== Procurement ==
The {{PAGENAME}} Booster is unlocked on the 2nd page of the [[Urban Legends Premium Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|55}}.

