== Description ==
Lowers the time it takes for the [[Extraction Shuttle]] to reach the [[Extraction Zone]] by 30%.

* This reduces a 2:00 minute call-in time to 1:24.
** If [[Complex Stratagem Plotting]] [[Operation Modifiers|Operation Modifier]] is active, [[Pelican 1|Pelican-1]] arrival time is reduced from 3:00 down to 2:06.

== Procurement ==
The {{PAGENAME}} Booster is unlocked on the 2nd page of the [[Democratic Detonation Premium Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|55}}.

== Tactical Information ==
* This can be of great use when attempting the '''Gone in 360 seconds!''' achievement.

