== Tactical Information ==

While only marginally useful in a full team - where ideally casualties can be absorbed by the increased number of reinforcements -, it does have niche use for solo 'divers who only receive five total reinforcements and would only receive one extra reinforcement from [[Increased Reinforcement Budget]].
