{{Infobox Booster
| title= Hellpod Space Optimization
| image= Hellpod Space Optimization Booster Icon.svg
| description= Helldivers come out of the Hellpod fully stocked on Ammo, Grenades, and Stims.
| source= [[Helldivers Mobilize! Warbond#Page_3|Helldivers Mobilize!]] <small>{{Tooltip|P3|Page 3}}</small>
| cost= {{Currency|Medals|15}}
| order=1
}}

'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Boosters|Booster]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''. When equipped, all [[Helldiver]]s in a squad will come out of their Hellpod (either initial deployment or being reinforced) fully stocked with Ammo, Grenades, and Stims. Depending on their equipped [[Armor Passives|armor]], their max number of equipment will vary.

== Procurement ==
The {{PAGENAME}} Booster is unlocked on the 3rd page of the [[Helldivers Mobilize Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|15}}.

== Tactical Information ==
* This booster is an [[Effects And Modifiers|effect]] that throughout a mission makes a Helldiver-squad deploy and reinforce with maximum ammo in primary and secondary weapons, grenades, and stims.
* Increases to maximum carry capacities like Med-Kit and Engineering Kit does not influence the booster. Helldivers will always get 100% of what they can carry.

== Trivia ==
* The {{PAGENAME}} is currently the only booster that can be active without a Helldiver equipping it. This is only possible if they are operating on the same planet as the [[Democracy Space Station]] when the [[Democracy Space Station#Tactical Actions|Orbtial Blockade Tactical Action]] is active.

