integrated-extinguishers.text:
{{DisambigMsg|the mission booster|the [[Armor Passives|armor passive]]|Integrated Explosives}}
{{Infobox Booster
|title=Integrated Extinguishers
|image=Integrated Extinguishers Booster Icon.svg
|description=Equips Helldiver uniforms with form-fitting, automated, rapid-response fire suppression systems. Significantly reduces the time it takes to naturally extinguish flames without conducting ground-aided smothering manuevers.
|source=[[Ironclad Democracy Premium Warbond#Page 3|Ironclad Democracy]] <small>{{Tooltip|P3|Page 3}}</small>
|cost={{Currency|Medals|65}}
|order=20
}}

'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Boosters|Booster]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''. When equipped, it reduces the amount of time to extinguish flames when any Helldiver squad member is lit on [[Status Effects#Fire|fire]].

== Description ==
Reduces the time in which a Helldiver is automatically put out from being on fire. This makes it so that Helldivers are no longer required to dive or go prone to put out a fire on themselves.

== Procurement ==
The {{PAGENAME}} Booster is unlocked on the 3rd page of the [[Ironclad Democracy Premium Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|65}}.

== Tactical Information ==
* Although it is possible to immediately extinguish a fire by diving, a Helldiver will remain on fire for <u>3</u> seconds before the fire extinguishes itself. With this Booster equipped, it is reduced down to <u>1.5</u> seconds.
* While situational awareness can make fire a minor issue, equipping this Booster allows for reduced harm against open flames.
** Depending on the enemy, equipped weaponry, and/or environment, the added protection can increase a Helldiver's life expectancy on the battlefield.
*** This is especially effective against the {{Incineration Corps}}[[Incineration Corps]], mitigating the need to bring armor with a passive that reduces fire damage, such as {{Passive|Inflammable}}.
*Helldivers inside the seats of a [[Fast Recon Vehicle]] or the gunner seats of the [[TD-220 Bastion MK XVI]] cannot easily dive without bailing, so this booster can save the need to [[Stim]] to stop fire damage.

